  message: "[REVIEW 2026-11-15: REAL TODAY, TEXT PARTLY STALE] 2026-11-15, dev e2b6ab8096: reproduced through `hypergumbo run` (fixtures ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/stable_id_items_review_11152026/work/WI-dolad). `{{~#each}}`, `{{#> layout}}`, `{{#*inline}}`: no symbol, contents miss a scope link. Split-line `{{#each\\n inner}}`: the block symbol IS emitted (`_BLOCK_RE` matches) but with scope `()`; only `_OPEN_RE` misses it. The closer pops a wrong block only when an enclosing block has the same name (each-in-each, or `{{#> layout}}` inside `{{#layout}}`); otherwise it is ignored. Also seen: `{{~> lead}}` emits no partial, and `{{#each items~}}` is labelled `each items~`. handlebars.py:58/62 exact; file last changed 2026-10-13. Full review: ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/stable_id_items_review_11152026/reports/WI-dolad.md. No status or priority change made by this review."  # df3d
