  message: "Fixed in PR #2200. Re-ran every filed form with --include-docs: `{{~#each}}`, an opener split across lines, `{{#> layout}}`, `{{#*inline}}` and a same-name close gave no block or a wrong scope on dev; each now emits its block and scopes its contents, and a closer closes the innermost block of its name. vault ui: 81 of 2,102 Handlebars symbols moved (3.85%). NOT DONE (filed): a block name with a hyphen or a dot is cut at it (`each-in` -> `each`; 43 on vault ui); a dynamic partial is named `(lookup`; Glimmer `<Foo>` tags are not tracked. The change moves stable ids, so it shipped in the stableid v14 -> v15 bump; the spec's history row lists the rule and the measured share. Repro record (both arms, commands and copied outputs): ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/stable_id_items_review_11152026/pr2/tracker/repros.md; per-package detail: pr2/STATUS.md; churn: pr2/final_measure.txt."  # 1f6f
